{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14852","headline":"栖岩寺隋文帝马脑盏歌 · 卢纶","name":"栖岩寺隋文帝马脑盏歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天宫宝器隋朝物，鏁在金函比金骨。\n开函捧之光乃发，阿修罗王掌中月。\n五云如拳轻复浓，昔曾噀酒今藏龙。\n规形环影相透彻，乱雪繁花千万重。\n可怜贞质无今名，可叹隋陵一抔土。\n宫中艳女满宫春，得亲此宝能几人。\n一留寒殿殿将坏，唯有幽光通隙尘。\n山中老僧眉似雪，忍死相传保扃鐍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}